pe":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしておめでとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は父のアメリカンフットボールの\n試合を観に行ってきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/10/11/1220565/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近中々都合が合わず行けてなかったので\n久しぶりの応援でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果的には負けてしまいましたが\n父がプレーしているところを\n久々に見る事ができて嬉しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20代のプレイヤーに混ざって\n頑張っていました(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな姿に元気ももらえました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もまだまだひよっこだな〜\n頑張らなきゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/10/11/1220565/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてやっぱり観戦、応援は\nとても楽しい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スポーツ観戦趣味です(_ _).｡o○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「希望の歌」ウルトラタワーさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてもキャッチーな曲調、\n高く綺麗な歌声、\nそして素敵な歌詞。\n何度でも聞きたくなる曲です。\n好きな歌詞がありすぎて\n1つに絞りたくないんだけど\nラスト